      "notes_append": "SOURCE IDENTITY REVIEW 2026-10-17\nFresh native inspection reads 3365D1 at AD (E-C3H2) and 3365K1 at AF (E-C3E5). The first digit has the same 3 form as the following digit. A1533-01 exact physical-card records 21:162:43 and 21:82:100 independently print 5803365 / 3365 and list these KM831 portions. Correct current card_type and printed_card_portion plus the two TXT digits. Earlier documented_A1_discrepancy/review observations saying printed1365 remain unchanged as historical records; this review supersedes their identity reading. Functions, circuits, portions, pins, locations, wires, prior answers and source provenance remain unchanged.",
